Port the original Exalt 0.3.0 platform boundary to Linux.

Replace the Windows message loop with SDL2 events while retaining upstream
ASCII/function-key values, five-window behavior and turn-based updates.
Use POSIX filesystem operations and the system SQLite public header, and
correct case-sensitive includes and the listener declaration.

This patch is part of the Guix Linux port, not an upstream game release.

